{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤詩織です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セゾン期間も もう終わりを迎えるころ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あわせて切った髪も もう結構伸びてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人セゾン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春夏で恋をして。\n秋冬で去っていく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時は 一時も止まらないから。\n変化しゆくから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一時も同じ瞬間なんて無いんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから本当に。一時一時を、大切に過ごさねばなと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時の PVでの私も もうどこにもいないんだなと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事な”時”や 忘れたくない”時”は。\nしっかり。逃さないように。\nその時に掴んで、しまっておかなきゃですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことを 伸びてきた髪を見ながら。\nふと。思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時は、気づけば 過ぎ去っていくものだなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人セゾンって本当にいい曲だな〜と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの中で本当に大切な曲になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この歌詞、本当に不思議なんですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今迄の自分と。\nこの歌詞に出会って セゾン期間戦った自分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの時期の自分にもしっくりくる歌詞で。\n三者三様に変容するというか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつ見ても 心にくる歌詞。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい曲に出逢えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また何ヶ月後かに見たら、思うことは変わってるのかなーなんて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すずもん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN34SP3ZJK09WA6A8Q9AGRX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リズム感とは こういうことか。と。\nすずもんのダンスを見ると学ぶこと沢山。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高にかっこいいです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詩織**"}],"source":"archive"}